// Marks an enemy summoned by a boss's own ability (Riff Riot's speakers, SpawnPackDeliveryData adds cast by a
// boss) - never a Director spawn. Lets hero effects tell "a boss's own minion" apart from a plain enemy of the
// same tier, e.g. Yoru's Mirror Step never instant-kills one (MirrorStepSkillAction).
component BossSummon
{
    EntityRef Boss;
}
